    "reviews": "\u201cIt\u2019s like Christmas morning but the Rubik's Cube you got in your stocking was accidentally the scary square from Hellraiser.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cBella Wants Blood is a tower defense game with a striking visual style and an excellent premise.\u201d<br>PCGamesN<br><br>\u201cBeing succinct is fine in my book and I had a good time for the few hours that it had my attention. Bella Wants Blood is a tasty little morsel indeed.\u201d<br>Rogueliker<br>",
